WEBVTT

00:00:06.007 --> 00:00:16.052
All the yogas end up at the Union
of your being with your attention.

00:00:19.251 --> 00:00:24.434
For example, you are listening to Me just now

00:00:24.514 --> 00:00:35.073
and your attention is inside-out in the
sense that you are watching Me outside.

00:00:36.204 --> 00:00:43.709
But if I say you that take your attention from outside
and put it inside from where you are listening to Me,

00:00:43.789 --> 00:00:48.599
can you do it? – You can’t!

00:00:50.637 --> 00:00:56.457
This attention goes outside of the human beings

00:00:57.536 --> 00:01:05.853
and that is the problem that we
cannot take our attention inside.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:16.155
That is the reason why our union
with our self is not established already.

00:01:16.235 --> 00:01:20.355
And, it has to be established!

00:01:23.004 --> 00:01:30.837
If you realise that there is someone
within us who is watching us all the time,

00:01:31.083 --> 00:01:36.904
who is noticing everything that we do;

00:01:40.278 --> 00:01:52.115
the one who is inside us and the one which looks outside

00:01:55.864 --> 00:02:05.191
but we cannot go to that personality or that entity or
that being,

00:02:09.077 --> 00:02:14.231
there is a gap between us and that personality.

00:02:17.371 --> 00:02:26.598
That personality is called in
the various scriptures as Spirit, as Atma.

00:02:30.287 --> 00:02:39.191
People have talked about it
and told that we have to manifest our Spirit.

00:02:39.272 --> 00:02:45.999
Means our attention should become one with that Spirit.

00:02:46.079 --> 00:02:49.849
It has been said by every scripture.

00:02:49.929 --> 00:02:57.370
Everyone of them has talked about us,
that once our attention meets that spirit,

00:02:57.456 --> 00:03:07.774
that is we are really ourselves, that Self,
then we are reborn and that is the self realisation.